  "ingredients": [
    "1.5 cups white sugar",
    "3 egg yolks, beaten",
    "0.5 cup unsweetened cocoa powder",
    "3 tablespoons cornstarch",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "3 cups milk",
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "1.5 teaspoons vanilla extract",
    "1 (9 inch) pie crust, baked",
    "1 cup frozen whipped topping, thawed"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/oD0Ld1Ap3BrDC1HeNQoMn1ec2yI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15756-chocolate-cream-pie-step-1-9e945f536deb4e0aaa9cb882b3c3989f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15756/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat sugar and egg yolks together in a large bowl until creamy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SBtW727Eg2notjMRDGmoD397pOo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15756-chocolate-cream-pie-step-2-e20978bb75d74956836b5e86e62551d4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15756/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in cocoa powder, cornstarch, and salt until well blended.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/3GWDLG8BZlTIWhHQJO3kG1sS3fM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15756-chocolate-cream-pie-step-3-fe99176462174f54be7eedce083800dc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15756/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Gently stir in milk.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uhNcEfsE26kw-ZXfPSQQkNlvyIA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15756-chocolate-cream-pie-step-4-e76423b4f4a74280988f73c043963d75.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15756/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour mixture into a large, heavy-bottomed saucepan. Cook over medium heat, stirring constantly with a wooden spoon, until boiling and thickened enough to coat the back of a metal spoon, 5 to 7 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dGeMaMhIRUZIaB6h4xrH5r-fXwU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15756-chocolate-cream-pie-step-5-2968d60c56544fc1b7da4a194478c5a6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15756/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from heat; stir in butter and vanilla extract. Set aside to cool slightly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QT0luAeNoOIxvuhB0Ug4lRv0wWY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15756-chocolate-cream-pie-step-6-1cacc1633a8d463a8eb637f87f7ca13a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15756/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour mixture into prepared pastry shell; chill pie in the refrigerator until set, 2 to 4 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/McLJjM2ykOTWsFXqW0YCnZ11J3M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-15756-chocolate-cream-pie-step-7-f23da79c3c124b74bcbad9876bee3ab1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/15756/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Garnish with whipped topping. Enjoy! Indulge in this decadent chocolate cream pie recipe that makes a silky smooth pudding-like filling from scratch for a chocolate lover's dream dessert. This impressive dessert comes together in no time, and the cornstarch helps stabalize and thicken the filling with ease.",
